text I wait for night to come and for Nagisa to take a bath before opening the closet.
text From its depths I pull out the class registry from when I was a student and look up Sunohara's home phone number.
text After I find it, I grab the phone and quickly dial in the number.
sound NRU.aac
text @[Voice]
text "Yes, Sunohara speaking."
text His mother's voice.
text @[Tomoya]
text Um, my name is Okazaki. Is Youhei-san there?
sound NRV.aac
text @[Voice]
text "Who might you be?"
text She probably thinks I'm trying to sell something.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm an old classmate from school. He should know who it is if you tell him that Okazaki is calling.
sound NRW.aac
text @[Voice]
text "Umm... Youhei isn't at home, he's living in a dorm."
