text Then we're just a day away.
music BGM20B.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Nagisa...?
sound NT2.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes?
text @[Tomoya]
text About tomorrow's date...
sound NT3.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes...?
text @[Tomoya]
text I want us to be in our uniforms.
sound NT4.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Huh...?
text @[Tomoya]
text You don't want to?
sound NT5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text My uniform? You mean my school uniform?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, the one you used to always wear.
sound NT6.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That would be embarrassing...
text @[Tomoya]
text But you were wearing it until just recently.
sound NT7.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yes, but...
sound NT8.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I already graduated.
sound NT9.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That would make me a liar.
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't worry about it. It's still spring break.
text @[Tomoya]
text Classes this school year don't start until after the beginning-of-school ceremonies in April.
text @[Tomoya]
text So no one's a student right now.
text @[Tomoya]
text You're not going to cause trouble for anyone.
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's go back to being students together for just one day.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay?
sound NTA.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But it'll be so embarrassing if our neighbors see.
sound NTB.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text A lot of them have already congratulated me on graduating.
sound NTC.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text If they see me walking around with my school uniform on, they'll think I'm strange.
text @[Tomoya]
text It'll be fine, we're leaving early in the morning.
sound NTD.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But we'll get home late.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then you can bring a change of clothes. You can change out of your uniform before we get back.
sound NTE.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Are you sure they won't find out...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Probably not.
sound NTF.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text It'll make my heart race.
text @[Tomoya]
text That's part of the fun, right?
sound NTG.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Maybe, but...
text @[Tomoya]
text So, what do you say? Will you wear your uniform with me?
sound NTH.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Umm...
text After she thinks it over for a while...
sound NTI.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text If that's what you want, Tomoya-kun, I'll do it.
text She ends up giving me an answer.
text @[Tomoya]
text Okay. Then it's decided.
text @[Tomoya]
text You can't go back on your word in the morning though, okay?
sound NTJ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Okay, I won't.
sound NTK.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But it really does make my heart race...
