text @[Nagisa]
text My time at this school...
sound NUZ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...was filled with many difficult experiences.
sound NV0.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Even at the best of times, I'm introverted and bad at making friends...
sound NV1.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Yet around the time I had finished my second year... I had finally met friends who let me into their circle.
sound NV2.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I thought then that once we became third-years, we would be able to become even better friends.
sound NV3.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But I was absent from school for most of the following year...
sound NV4.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text The next time I went to school, two weeks had passed since the beginning of classes.
sound NV5.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I was all alone in my new class.
sound NV6.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Everything changes with time...
sound NV7.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text And once I had learned that, the fact paralyzed me.
sound NV8.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That's why I stood still at the bottom of this hill.
sound NV9.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text But then...
