sound NVA.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text The one to push me forward from there was Tomoya-kun.
sound NVB.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Every time he found me standing at the bottom of the hill, immobilized and worrying, he gave me the push I needed.
sound NVC.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That first day we met, he told me that if things had changed so much, I would just need to find new things to take their place.
sound NVD.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text He scolded me then.
sound NVE.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text The month after that, I met Sunohara-san, Nishina-san, Sugisaka-san, and Koumura-sensei...
sound NVF.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text All of you, as well as others out of sight, supported my dream of creating the drama club.
sound NVG.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text There's no way I would have been able to do it alone.
sound NVH.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text We also had a match against the basketball team.
sound NVI.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text We were able to win, but only because we all came together as one.
sound NVJ.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text That taught me that if we work together, even for a short time, we can do something amazing...
sound NVK.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text After that, we worked hard toward the performances at the Founder's Festival.
sound NVL.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text While I ended up crying on stage...
sound NVM.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text I was able to perform the play to the end.
sound NVN.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text It was the first time I had worked toward a single goal and accomplished it.
sound NVO.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text Even someone like me...
sound NVP.aac
text @[Nagisa]
text ...was supported by so many people.
